{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51382","headline":"传奇小说（诗句） · 沈亚之","name":"传奇小说（诗句）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"命笑无人笑，含娇何处娇。\n徘徊花上月，空（一作「虚」）度可怜宵。\n（《艺林伐山》十七。\n又《诗人玉屑》十二《品藻》引後二句（《太平广记》卷三二六《沈警》条引《异闻录》载此爲沈警诗。\n《诗人玉屑》以爲沈亚之作，未详所据。\n程毅中《〈异闻集〉考》因疑《沈警》篇爲沈亚之作。\n惜尚乏他证佐定之。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈亚之","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51382.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51382","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}